<schema name="iam" layers="0" rect-visible="true" fill-color="#dbe8ff" name-color="#263238">
	<role name="postgres"/>
	<comment> <![CDATA[Identity & Security — Customer/Venue/Admin identities, OTP, refresh-token rotation, Owner Password secret isolation, security rate-limit fallback and User commitment serialization. Generic RBAC from the visual reference was NOT copied because E7GZ Product defines fixed audiences/capabilities and we do not invent new Product permissions. pgModeler 1.2.2 note: username/login/admin-email columns use built-in text; case-insensitive normalized uniqueness is represented by functional indexes instead of citext.]]> </comment>
</schema>

