<table name="resource" layers="0" collapse-mode="2" max-obj-count="10" z-value="0">
	<schema name="resource"/>
	<role name="postgres"/>
	<comment> <![CDATA[Base state and operational restriction are INDEPENDENT — a resource may be ACTIVE and unsellable.

Source/critical constraints:
- ck_console_iff_playstation
- uq_resource_name (venue_id, activity, name)
- ix_resource_eligible WHERE base_state='ACTIVE' AND operational_restriction='NONE']]> </comment>
