	<role name="postgres"/>
	<comment> <![CDATA[Operational Ban Instance. At most one ACTIVE Ban per user; retroactive qualification activates NOW, never back-dated.

Source/critical constraints:
- ux_one_active_ban (user_id) WHERE status='ACTIVE']]> </comment>
