	<role name="postgres"/>
	<comment> <![CDATA[Worker-only mutation. PENDING/FAILED -> SENT | FAILED | DEAD_LETTER (attempt +1). SENT is terminal. DEAD_LETTER is terminal except the explicit audited Admin recovery (-> PENDING). SMS only for OTP-class catalogue codes.

Source/critical constraints:
- ux_delivery_once (notification_id, channel)]]> </comment>
