	<comment> <![CDATA[TECHNICAL notification catalogue (not a Product enum). One row per notification code: reference rule, allowed recipient types and the channel policy. Rows are registered by deployment from the FRS notification catalogue and are append-only. SMS is permitted only for OTP-class codes (launch rule: SMS = OTP only).]]> </comment>
	<position x="5140" y="9800"/>
	<column name="code" not-null="true">
		<type name="text" length="0"/>
	</column>
	<column name="reference_type" not-null="true">
