	<comment> <![CDATA[APPEND-ONLY (no UPDATE/DELETE/TRUNCATE, trigger and privilege level). Actor provenance is validated at INSERT (ADMIN -> active Admin, CUSTOMER -> User, VENUE -> Venue Account, SYSTEM -> no actor id). payload is rejected fail-closed if it contains credential/secret keys at any depth. Structured trace columns replace free-form JSON for request, client and state-transition metadata.]]> </comment>
